  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Texture class manages the complete lifecycle of 2D textures within a WebGL rendering pipeline. It handles asynchronous loading from URIs, creation of GPU resources via WebGL2RenderingContext, and configuration of filtering/wrapping parameters. It integrates serialization capabilities via JsonSerializable and manages resource cleanup through EngineCache upon destruction."
  },
